@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@apiPrefix = /v1
@accessToken = your_access_token_here
@memberId = member_id_here

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────
###  TEAM MANAGEMENT
###  Base: /v1/team
###  All routes require: Authorization: Bearer <token>
###  Only users with teamManagement permissions can access these.
###  Non-team-member users (admin, property_owner) bypass permission checks.
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────


### Get All Team Members
### Requires: teamManagement.read = true
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/team/members
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### Add Team Member
### Requires: teamManagement.edit = true
### Creates a new user with type: 'team_member', linked to the caller via teamId.
### All permissions default to false — explicitly set only what is needed.
POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/team/member
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "John",
  "lastName": "Doe",
  "email": "john.doe@example.com",
  "password": "securepassword123",
  "permissions": {
    "dashboard": { "read": true, "edit": false },
    "analytics": { "read": true, "edit": false },
    "allBookings": { "read": true, "edit": true },
    "allCustomers": { "read": true, "edit": false },
    "allProperty": { "read": true, "edit": false },
    "propertyOwner": { "read": false, "edit": false },
    "pendingKYC": { "read": true, "edit": true },
    "offer": { "read": false, "edit": false },
    "teamManagement": { "read": false, "edit": false },
    "helpCenter": { "read": true, "edit": true },
    "profile": { "read": true, "edit": true }
  }
}


### Add Team Member - Minimal Permissions (read-only access)
POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/team/member
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Jane",
  "lastName": "Smith",
  "email": "jane.smith@example.com",
  "password": "securepassword123",
  "permissions": {
    "dashboard": { "read": true, "edit": false }
  }
}


### Update Team Member
### Requires: teamManagement.edit = true
### Can update: firstName, lastName, permissions
### Only the team owner can update their own members (teamId must match).
PUT {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/team/member/{{memberId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "John",
  "lastName": "Updated",
  "permissions": {
    "dashboard": { "read": true, "edit": true },
    "analytics": { "read": true, "edit": false },
    "allBookings": { "read": true, "edit": true },
    "allCustomers": { "read": true, "edit": true },
    "allProperty": { "read": true, "edit": false },
    "propertyOwner": { "read": false, "edit": false },
    "pendingKYC": { "read": true, "edit": false },
    "offer": { "read": true, "edit": true },
    "teamManagement": { "read": true, "edit": false },
    "helpCenter": { "read": true, "edit": true },
    "profile": { "read": true, "edit": true }
  }
}


### Update Team Member - Permissions Only
PUT {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/team/member/{{memberId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "permissions": {
    "allBookings": { "read": true, "edit": false },
    "helpCenter": { "read": true, "edit": true }
  }
}


### Delete Team Member
### Requires: teamManagement.edit = true
### Permanently deletes the team member user document.
### Only the team owner can delete their own members (teamId must match).
DELETE {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/team/member/{{memberId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
